
@startuml 03_SettingsService

title 3. SettingsService - 사운드/음악 설정

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class PlayerSettings {
  - SettingsId: Guid
  - PlayerId: Guid
  - IsSoundOn: bool
  - IsMusicOn: bool
  - MusicVolumeLevel: int
  + TurnSoundOnOrOff(): void
  + TurnMusicOnOrOff(): void
  + ChangeMusicVolume(newVolumeLevel: int): void
}

interface SettingsRepository {
  + FindSettingsByPlayerId(playerId: Guid): Task<PlayerSettings>
  + SaveSettings(settings: PlayerSettings): Task
}

interface SettingsService {
  + GetSettings(playerId: Guid): Result<PlayerSettings, ServiceError>
  + UpdateSettings(playerId: Guid, isSoundOn: bool, isMusicOn: bool, musicVolumeLevel: int): Result<PlayerSettings, ServiceError>
}

class ServiceError <<see 00_CommonTypes>>

SettingsService ..> SettingsRepository : Task<T> 결과를 기다림(await)
SettingsService ..> PlayerSettings
SettingsRepository ..> PlayerSettings
SettingsService ..> ServiceError : 실패 시 반환

note right of SettingsService
  판정 규칙: MusicVolumeLevel은 0~100 범위를 벗어나면
  InputWasInvalid 실패.
end note

@enduml
